  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): チャービル",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%81%E3%83%A3%E3%83%BC%E3%83%93%E3%83%AB",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 108250443,
      "text": "チャービル はセリ科シャク属に属する一年草。パセリに類似する。フレンチパセリ 、ガーデンチャービル ともよばれる。マイルドな味わいの料理の風味付けに用いられ、フランス料理にも使用されるハーブである。フランス名でセルフィーユ 、和名でウイキョウゼリ（茴香芹）ともよばれる。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Chervil",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chervil",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1360920171,
      "text": "Chervil, sometimes called French parsley or garden chervil, is a delicate annual herb related to parsley. It was formerly called myrhis due to its volatile oil with an aroma similar to the resinous substance myrrh. It is commonly used to season mild-flavoured dishes and is a constituent of the French herb mixture fines herbes."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Anthriscus cerefolium",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anthriscus_cerefolium",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 171666029,
      "text": "Anthriscus cerefolium, el perifollo, cerefolio, perejil francés o prifolio, es una especie del género Anthriscus emparentada con el perejil. Es nativa del Cáucaso pero fue diseminada en toda Europa por los romanos, donde se naturalizó."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Cerfeuil commun",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cerfeuil_commun",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 239523981,
      "text": "Le Cerfeuil commun est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Apiacées (ombellifères). C'est une plante herbacée probablement originaire de Russie, cultivée comme plante condimentaire pour ses feuilles au goût légèrement anisé."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Cerefólio",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ceref%C3%B3lio",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 48555869,
      "text": "O cerefólio ou cerefolho, é uma espécie de planta do género Anthriscus, na família Apiaceae, aparentada com a salsa. É nativa do Cáucaso, mas foi disseminada pelos romanos por toda a Europa, onde se naturalizou."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Servil",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Servil",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29219881,
      "text": "Servil, terkadang disebut peterseli Prancis atau servil taman, adalah rempah daun tahunan halus yang masih bersaudara dengan peterseli. Servilnya dulunya disebut myrhis karena minyaknya yang mudah menguap dengan aroma yang mirip dengan zat resin myrrh. Ini biasanya digunakan untuk membumbui hidangan dengan rasa ringan dan merupakan komponen dari fines herbes, yaitu rempah daun campuran Prancis."
    }
  },
  "sections": {
    "cultivation": {
      "ja": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (ja): チャービル § 栽培",
        "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%81%E3%83%A3%E3%83%BC%E3%83%93%E3%83%AB#%E6%A0%BD%E5%9F%B9",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
        "revision": 108250443,
        "heading": "栽培",
        "text": "チャービルの根は長いため、植え替えは難しい。冷涼で湿った環境を好み、それ以外の環境では薹立ちという現象を起こしてすぐに種ができてしまう。葉の収穫は薹立ちを防ぐのにも役立つ。",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "en": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (en): Chervil § Cultivation",
        "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chervil#Cultivation",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
        "revision": 1360920171,
        "heading": "Cultivation",
        "text": "Transplanting chervil can be difficult, due to the long taproot. It prefers a cool and moist location; otherwise, it rapidly goes to seed (also known as bolting). It is usually grown as a cool-season crop, like lettuce, being planted in early spring and late fall or in a winter greenhouse. Regular harvesting of leaves also reduces bolting. If plants bolt despite precautions, new seeds can be periodically re-sown throughout the growing season, thus producing fresh plants as older plants bolt and go out of production.",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "fr": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Cerfeuil commun § Culture",
        "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cerfeuil_commun#Culture",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
        "revision": 239523981,
        "heading": "Culture",
        "text": "Préfère un sol léger et frais, bien ameubli.\nMultiplication par semis échelonnés depuis février jusqu'au début du mois de septembre.\nLa récolte peut commencer environ six semaines après le semis. les feuilles de la base sont cueillies au fur et à mesure des besoins, et peut continuer jusqu'à la période de montaison.\nPlante peu sensible aux maladies et parasites.",
        "truncated": false
      }
    }
  },
